@startuml UC-65
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-65.md
title UC-65: Lock / Unlock Account
footer Feature AUSR-03 | Business rules: BR-03, BR-07
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/UsersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "UserService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Click Lock or Unlock on a user
MVC -> API : PATCH /api/admin/users/{id}/status { status }
API -> SVC : SetStatusAsync(currentUserId, id, status)
alt id = current Admin
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "You cannot lock your own account"
else another user
  SVC -> DB : Load user
  alt Lock
    SVC -> DB : Set Status = Locked\nClear RefreshToken + expiry (BR-03)
  else Unlock
    SVC -> DB : Set Status = Active
  end
  SVC -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show new status
end

@enduml
